     The iissll driver provides access to sensor data provided by the Inter‐
     sil(TM) I2C ISL29018 Digital Ambient Light Sensor and Proximity Sensor
     with Interrupt Function.  Functionality is basic and provided through the
     sysctl(8) interface.

     On a system using device.hints(5), these values are configurable for iissll:

     _h_i_n_t_._i_s_l_._%_d_._a_t    target iicbus(4).

     _h_i_n_t_._i_s_l_._%_d_._a_d_d_r  iissll i2c address on the iicbus(4).

